  theorem-shaped necessary condition:
    A remaining strict counterexample with <=6 multiples of 14 must
    defeat every denominator-14 one-sided core aperture: each aperture
    is either first-order AP/GW-balanced or saturated by the few
    14-multiple danger combs.  Uncertified rows are therefore not
    generic counterexamples; they are exactly local-apex-obstructed
    rows needing off-apex Haar/source-kernel or state-lift machinery.

